{
 "id": 382657,
 "name": "Part 1: Slack Workbot shows Salesforce Product details when you post a URL in Slack ",
 "description": "1. Type or paste a **Salesforce Product URL** in the Workbot DM or in a channel Workbot is in.\n2. Workbot will search Salesforce and your Price Book entries to obtain information about the Product.\n3. Workbot will automatically reply with a message showing more information about that particular Product. \n4. Workbot will prompt you with a button to update the Salesforce Product Activity.\n5. Activate or deactivate your Product from within Slack with Workbot.\n\n**Notes**\n- This recipe works together with the [Update Salesforce Product Active state by Product ID with Slack Workbot](https://www.workato.com/recipes/382678-internal-update-salesforce-product-active-state-by-product-id#recipe) recipe. To use this recipe, copy and run both recipes.\n- Workbot must be invited to Slack channels before it can post messages in those channels.",
 "applications": [
